  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_weapon/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">각종무기류(Sword,Mace,Fencing,Archery,Wrestling)</font></a></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_ta/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">전술(Tactics)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_ana/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">해부학(Anatomy)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                            l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_he/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">힐링(Healing)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_focus/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">집중(Focus)</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_pa/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">방패술(Parry)</font></a></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>ANATOMY<img align=\"right\" border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/logo_focus.gif\" width=\"100\">\n</b></span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">직업 \n                            타이틀: Healer</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사용시 \n                            주 상승 스탯: </span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Intelligence</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">사용시 \n                            부가 상승 스탯: </span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Dexterity</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬사용 \n                            : 스킬 시전 후에 타겟 클릭</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">수련 \n                            가능 NPC: </span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Healer, \n                            Healer Guildmaster</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬 \n                            Up: 없음</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\"> \n                            해부학(아나토미)는 상대방의 현재 \n                            민첩과 체력을 알수 있게 하는 \n\n            스킬입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">아나토미스킬 65이상부터 \n\n                상대방의 스테미나를 볼 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">만약 해부학(아나토미)스킬을 사용하여 목표물을 조사를 \n                            해봅시다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">목표물이 \n                            덱스 100과 체력 100을 지니고 있다면 다음과 같은 \n                            메시지가 보이게 될 것입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                            초인적으로강하고, 초인적인 빠르기입니다\"</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"189\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬에 \n                                        따른 표시 (덱스)</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"289\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">스킬에 \n                                        따른 표시 (체력)</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"58\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Stats</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"189\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"거의 \n                                        서있기도 힘듭니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"289\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        약해서 작은 물건을 드는 것도 힘듭니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"58\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">0-9</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"189\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"무척 \n                                        둔해보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"289\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        조금 허약해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"58\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">10-19</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"189\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"조금 \n                                        둔해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"289\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        조금 약해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"58\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">20-29</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"189\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"민첩성은 \n                                        보통입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"289\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        보통 체력을 가진것 같아 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"58\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">30-39</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"189\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"조금 \n                                        민첩해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"289\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        약간 강해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"58\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">40-49</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"189\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"아주 \n                                        민첩해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"289\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        매우 강해 보입니다..\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"58\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">50-59</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"189\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"대단히 \n                                        민첩해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"289\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        무척 강해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"58\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">60-69</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"189\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"엄청나게 \n                                        민첩해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"289\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        엄청나게 강해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"58\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">70-79</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"189\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"번개같이 \n                                        빨라 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"289\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        황소처럼 강해보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"58\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">80-89</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"189\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"이렇게 \n                                        빠른건 처음 봅니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"289\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        지금까지 본 것중에 강해 보입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"58\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">90-99</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"189\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"초인적인 \n                                        빠르기입니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td width=\"289\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">\"그것은 \n                                        초인적으로 강합니다.\"</span></font></p></td>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/alpha_background_2.gif\" width=\"58\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">100+</span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/point.gif\" width=\"15\"> \n                            힐링과 연관된 스킬로서 \n\n                부활이나 독치료 힐을 할수 있게 해줍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana,굴림체\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">자세한 \n                     